OL,3,GNEWSANew gas-fired power station at
OL,4,APeterhead is approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has given its
OL,7,Fconsent for the construction of a
OL,8,Fcontroversial new gas-fired power
OL,9,Fstation at Peterhead.
OL,11,FThe scheme, by SSE and Equinor, will
OL,12,Fgenerate about 900 megawatts of
OL,13,Felectricity and includes provision for
OL,14,Fcarbon capture.
OL,16,FEnvironmental group Friends of the
OL,17,FEarth Scotland insist the decision
OL,18,Flocks Scotland into a dependence on
OL,19,Ffossil fuels.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
