OL,3,GNEWSANew gas-fired power station at
OL,4,APeterhead is approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut supporters say new carbon capture
OL,7,Ftechnology could slash emissions from
OL,8,Fthe new site by more than 90%. SSE said
OL,9,Fits delivery was contingent on progress
OL,10,Fwith the Scottish carbon capture
OL,11,Fcluster.
